ror_code":"no_reviews"},{"game_id":"steam-5141380","metric":"demo_ccu","observed_at":"2026-10-26T06:32:09Z","value":0,"status":"ok","source_url":"https://api.steampowered.com/ISteamUserStats/GetNumberOfCurrentPlayers/v1/?appid=5221530","error_code":null}],"events":[{"id":"steam-steam-5141380-1846018067927767","game_id":"steam-5141380","kind":"announcement","title":"Version 2.016!","summary":"Version 2.016!​​I made some big changes to the game!Upgrade tree redesign!I redesigned the Upgrade tree! I'm not sure if it's better or worse... but it feels different to play through. I hope it's better.​​Here's the general changes with the tree: I haven't added any new upgrades, but I changed around the prices of some of the upgrades, and I moved a lot of stuff around. Now most of the White Click upgrades are to the top left of the tree, most of the Main loop white gain upgrades are to the top","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-07T23:12:06Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846018067927767","verified_at":"2026-10-20T23:10:42Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-5141380-1844751498222836","game_id":"steam-5141380","kind":"announcement","title":"Version 2.002 Bugfix!","summary":"! It feels good to have cleaned out so many bugs all at once! Thanks to the kind people on galaxy click for all their help, as well as some of the players here on itch!Okay so first off, the biggest change by far would be the glitch where, after returning to the main menu (or leaving the game) and coming back, all of your on-screen save data is reset, but your in-code save data isn't. I don't know if I've 100% fixed this issue, but I changed how the game saves your upgrades and settings values, ","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-09-24T22:35:25Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1844751498222836","verified_at":"2026-10-20T23:10:42Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-5141380-1844115010505521","game_id":"steam-5141380","kind":"update","title":"Loop Loader Demo Update V2.01!","summary":"New Update! Version 2.01!Hi! I added a new update to the game! Although... this update brings along some good new and bad news.Revamped the previous Save System:Previously, the save system didn't save your data very efficiently, and in order to avoid future game crashes, I designed the system to delete your old save file each time a new update would come around.This was obviously a problem, so I completely redesigned it. Now each version of the game you're playing on should (in theory as this is","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-09-22T22:10:47Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1844115010505521","verified_at":"2026-10-20T23:10:42Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"}],"analyses":[],"news_status":{"steam-5141380":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T08:45:59Z","status":"ok","all_sources_checked_at":"2026-10-26T08:45:59Z","error_codes":[]}},"news_last_attempt_at":{"steam-5141380":"2026-10-26T08:45:59Z"},"notices":[],"news_sources":{"5141380":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T08:45:59Z","last_success_at":"2026-10-26T08:45:59Z","status":"ok","error_codes":[],"last_fulltext_checked_at":"2026-10-26T08:45:59Z"},"5221530":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T08:45:59Z","last_success_at":"2026-10-26T08:45:59Z","status":"ok","error_codes":[],"last_fulltext_checked_at":"2026-10-26T08:45:59Z"}},"context_snapshots":[{"schema_version":1,"game_id":"steam-5141380","app_id":5141380,"app_scope":"base","observed_at":"2026-10-26T06:15:35Z","source_url":"https://api.steampowered.com/IStoreBrowseService/GetItems/v1/","context":{"country":"KR","language":"koreana","batch_size":100},"status"